      },
      "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "Thanks @maflcko for reviewing. Force-pushed 88d40ec15510a8d029c1eaffbae9c068da18f5f9 addressing https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36439#discussion_r4192615551\r\n\r\n> I think functional tests are run at double saturation (2*nproc) sometimes, so it would be good to check this doesn't regress either.\r\n\r\nBy what I found, [only the job \"test ancestor commits\" does it](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/.github/ci-test-each-commit-exec.py#L64). Agree it's worth checking.\r\n\r\n> create some plots to show this is an improvement (and to see the performance plot around the values)\r\n\r\nWill do.",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-06T13:20:54Z",
      "includesCreatedEdit": false,
      "isMinimized": false,
      "minimizedReason": "",
      "reactionGroups": [],
      "url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36439#issuecomment-6017182631",
